# ORCA input: geometry optimization + frequencies for water
# Run:  orca orca_water_opt_freq.inp > orca_water_opt_freq.out
# Check output for: "ORCA TERMINATED NORMALLY", "THE OPTIMIZATION HAS CONVERGED",
#                   "FINAL SINGLE POINT ENERGY", and zero imaginary frequencies.
# For a transition state replace "Opt" with "OptTS" and expect exactly one imaginary frequency.
! B3LYP D3BJ def2-SVP Opt Freq
%pal nprocs 4 end
* xyz 0 1
O  0.000  0.000  0.000
H  0.000  0.760  0.590
H  0.000 -0.760  0.590
*
